author: maintainer-agent
estimated_minutes: 120
acceptance_criteria: "pm release gains an ergonomic path to also reset status (flag such as --reopen/--status open, or at minimum a one-line hint that the item remains in_progress and unclaimed); pause-task alias behavior is referenced as the existing combined spelling; MCP pm_release mirrors the option; docs + linked tests; default behavior unchanged"
parent: pm-dj98
risk: low
confidence: high
resolution: "SDK release preserves status and emits released_unclaimed_in_progress with pause-task guidance when the normalized item status equals the configured in-progress workflow role, including custom review statuses."
expected_result: "Shared SDK and CLI contracts preserve configured workflow semantics, trustworthy recovery evidence, bounded output and deterministic verification."
actual_result: "PR 1195 review corrections passed 210 focused tests and full coverage: 8422 tests in 608 files; statements 62222/62222, branches 47190/47190, functions 12920/12920, lines 59845/59845. Full typecheck and ESLint pass. Context evaluation including all token surfaces and the temporary Node/Bun SDK/CLI manual workflow pass. Hosted verification of this corrected head and publication remain subsequent claims."
